[{"client_msg_id":"a3a18eb6-a3d9-4491-bf66-d379945a8341","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"ちょっと抵抗感あるけどw","ts":"1634648081.273800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TEl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e25beca8-6a5e-4515-bc06-63359fed31b4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なるほど","ts":"1634647445.273400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SIk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53a1a0c8-e035-4b60-8875-2c7b69cda24f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/5ducks5/status/1450262102501855240?t=hFnd0WWQp64fcsjLJ2zW5w\u0026amp;s=19|https://twitter.com/5ducks5/status/1450262102501855240?t=hFnd0WWQp64fcsjLJ2zW5w\u0026amp;s=19\u003e","ts":"1634647442.273200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/5ducks5|@5ducks5\u003e: 使いかけの瓶ソースにすぐカビが生えるというお話があったのですが、蓋を閉めた後に毎回振ると少し長持ちします。空気中の雑菌が表面について、それが繁殖してカビるわけですけど、奴らは好気性なので振って混ぜると酸素に触れなくなって繁殖速度が遅くなります。糠床を毎日混ぜるのと似た感じですね。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FCBdrz7UcAYpyvr.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"あひるさん🇺🇸研究開発職","author_subname":"@5ducks5","author_link":"https://twitter.com/5ducks5/status/1450262102501855240","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1449972898580496385/oaIV34cr_normal.jpg","text":"使いかけの瓶ソースにすぐカビが生えるというお話があったのですが、蓋を閉めた後に毎回振ると少し長持ちします。空気中の雑菌が表面について、それが繁殖してカビるわけですけど、奴らは好気性なので振って混ぜると酸素に触れなくなって繁殖速度が遅くなります。糠床を毎日混ぜるのと似た感じですね。 \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FCBdrz7UcAYpyvr.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FCBdrz7UcAYpyvr.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1634604404,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/5ducks5/status/1450262102501855240?t=hFnd0WWQp64fcsjLJ2zW5w\u0026amp;s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/5ducks5/status/1450262102501855240?t=hFnd0WWQp64fcsjLJ2zW5w\u0026amp;s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":3,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U022XK5866Q","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DQfO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9a7a97d-865d-4105-a0ea-458c60a78cce","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"ありがとうございます、分割解凍して使ってみます。","ts":"1634640823.271300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UGHD6GP16"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kSMmk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"25f49a32-08d0-433e-b2f8-d1ac6603d2ca","type":"message","user":"UGHD6GP16","text":"よほど切れ味が悪くない限り切れるはず……","ts":"1634640655.270900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q1+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d26446d6-239c-4bde-8103-458b3359e1ee","type":"message","user":"UGHD6GP16","text":"冷凍したままで分割できるならそれが一番ですね。包丁とかでﾊﾟｷｯと分割","ts":"1634640621.270400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bAnt7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c3c4dd0-a398-4e60-b021-384d9a717595","type":"message","user":"UGHD6GP16","text":"あ、もともと冷凍してある奴が届いてるんですね。誤読してました","ts":"1634640592.269800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bYcqL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efb2f689-ab58-4fa6-af41-752e97730d7a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、利用方法はいろいろあるから、匂いとかが誤魔化しやすい料理がいいかな(そこまで匂うことはないと思うが)","ts":"1634640550.269300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jin5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0c0eba9-1bae-466c-8932-8916543663c1","type":"message","user":"UGHD6GP16","text":"冷凍しちゃったのは、超高級牛丼用として使うとかで","ts":"1634640475.268200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZAq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b397055d-0498-4e85-a354-13d2da750314","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"一食では、無理しないとなかなか…","ts":"1634640458.267900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l9=3G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2dbc5b08-81f1-4e03-ac02-b1935998560a","type":"message","user":"UGHD6GP16","text":"袋に適当に詰めて冷凍庫へGoでしょうかね既に案が出ている通り","ts":"1634640442.267500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/CF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"778022d6-7385-437b-baa1-a3408d8ea0f3","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"2回でなら全然食べきれると思いますが、やはり凍ったまま頑張って分割かなぁ。","ts":"1634640429.266900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FXh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8282e5ab-f086-4b82-9d04-490255a0c880","type":"message","user":"UGHD6GP16","text":"500gは1食分では無かった……（困惑）","ts":"1634640412.266500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+Ng"}]},{"client_msg_id":"270debc3-9c93-427d-87e3-d48308d62f98","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"さっと分割してジップロックでそれぞれ保存(できれば手袋をして作業がいいかな)\nで食べやすいレベルで消費していくのがいいと思う","ts":"1634640283.265300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9o83"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf7b9714-25d3-4d21-b4d1-5d12f7b4d55f","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"パッケージから出せば分割はできるのかもしれません。","ts":"1634640194.264500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EeNF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c19ad2a-e083-4543-909c-ed9d314fd8b3","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"いい冷蔵庫といい包丁なら凍ったまま切れたり","ts":"1634640087.263800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JYN6f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08e40156-9bca-44b1-a038-c06333ab73c5","type":"m